# STIG CNTR-K8-000330: The Kubernetes Kubelet must have the 'readOnlyPort' flag dis
# STIG ID: V-242387 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `k8s-cntr-k8-000330-kubelet-readonly-port-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `kubernetes`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG CNTR-K8-000330: The Kubernetes Kubelet must have the 'readOnlyPort' flag disabled.`
    description `The Kubernetes Kubelet must have the 'readOnlyPort' flag disabled.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `kubernetes,stig,disa-stig,kubelet`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CNTR-K8-000330,NIST-800-53:AC-3`
    control_objective `AC-3`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Kubernetes:cluster:k8s-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for CNTR-K8-000330.`

    component_id `comp-k8s-cluster`

    impl_AC_3 `This control is validated by checking the required Kubernetes configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT kubelet_config
        path `/var/lib/kubelet/config.yaml`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE config_check
        content string not_contains `readOnlyPort`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF config_check
            OBJECT_REF kubelet_config
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
